<title>USA: Astoria Financial sets 2.5 mln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Astoria Financial sets 2.5 mln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Astoria Financial Corp said on Wednesday its board of directors appproved a program to repurchase, at management discretion, up to 2.5 million of its outstanding shares over the next two years.</p>
<p>This was the company's fifth stock repurchase plan, Astoria said. Purchases would be made in open-market or in privately negotiated transactions, the company said.</p>
<p>Astoria Financial said it had repurchased a total of 4.89 million shares of its common stock since its first repurchase program began in April 1994.</p>
